WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.000
[Peach Open Movie Project presents]

2
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
♪ Cheerful orchestral music ♪

3
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.000
A large bunny wakes up and stretches outside his burrow.

4
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
He sniffs a yellow butterfly fluttering nearby.

5
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:39.000
The bunny smiles and enjoys the warm sunshine.

6
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:45.000
A tiny chinchilla hides behind a tree, watching him.

7
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.000
The chinchilla throws an apple core at the bunny's head!

8
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:59.000
The bunny is startled but shrugs it off.

9
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Two squirrels join in, plotting more mischief.

10
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:25.000
They ambush the butterfly — the bunny's new friend.

11
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:34.000
The bunny is heartbroken. His expression changes.

12
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:44.000
He clenches his fists. Revenge is coming.

13
00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:46.000
The bunny sets an elaborate trap in the forest.

14
00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:40.000
One by one, the rodents fall for his tricks.

15
00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:54.000
♪ Triumphant music swells ♪

16
00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:44.000
The bunny walks into the sunset, victorious.

17
00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:55.000
